{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06092","headline":"晓行巴峡 · 王维","name":"晓行巴峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"际晓投巴峡，余春忆帝京。\n晴江一女浣，朝日衆鸡鸣。\n水国舟中市，山桥树杪行。\n登高万井出，眺迥二流明。\n人作殊方语，鸎爲故国声。\n赖多山水趣，稍解别离情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}